  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) - - Strengthening of Women led Banana Value Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project entails sourcing of high quality bananas from women and processing into safe and quality banana crisps for diverse consumer base within Mbeya and nearby regions. The project has strong multiplier effect through employment creation and steady incomes to rural based women. The livelihoods of rural communities will be enhanced in the process.</narrative>
  </description>
